Package: MetricFishR
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Morphometric Pipeline for Fish Diversity
        (Descriptive, Inferential Statistics, Wilks, PCA)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("OWO Nicolas Roland",
    email = "owonicolvs3457@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 7-step morphometric pipeline (without discriminant factor
    analysis) for the analysis of fish diversity: descriptive statistics
    exported to Excel, inferential analysis with selection of significant
    variables, Bartlett's identity test, Pearson correlation matrix with
    interactive exclusion, Wilks' lambda test with adjustable F threshold,
    and principal component analysis (PCA) with plot export.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/owonicolvs3457/MetricFishR
BugReports: https://github.com/owonicolvs3457/MetricFishR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: factoextra, FactoMineR, FSA, ggcorrplot, ggplot2, grDevices,
        openxlsx, psych, RColorBrewer, stats, tcltk, utils
Suggests: rlang (>= 1.1.7), testthat (>= 3.0.0)
